Idea: ${$('On form submission').item.json['Raw Idea']}
Audience: ${$('On form submission').item.json['Target Audience'] || 'general'}
Tone: ${$('On form submission').item.json['Tone'] || 'friendly'}
Total slides: ${$('On form submission').item.json['Number of slides']} (1 cover + ${Number($('On form submission').item.json['Number of slides']) - 2} content slides + 1 closing call-to-action slide).

Rules:
- Fix grammar in the idea (e.g. "5 reasons your pet needs a vet").
- Do not use country-specific statistics unless they apply to India. If unsure, leave numbers out.
- Slide headings: max 7 words. Slide body: max ${$('On form submission').item.json['Platform'] === 'LinkedIn' ? 40 : 28} words.
- Each content slide must have a different point. Make the cover title a strong hook.
- Colors must be hex codes with strong contrast between background_color and text_color.
- Fonts must be one of: Montserrat, Poppins, Lato, Roboto, Oswald, Raleway, Playfair Display, Open Sans.
- The design theme must suit the topic and audience.

Research brief:
${$('Research').item.json.candidates[0].content.parts[0].text}`
